meta {
  name: show workspace in Finder
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/workspace/reveal
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}"
  }
}

docs {
  Show a live session's working folder in Finder on the server machine (card 462). The body names the session only; the server takes the folder the socket resolved for it, the path the workspace_info frame carries, and realises it before opening. 204 opened, 400 missing or malformed sessionId, 404 unknown session or no directory there, 501 non-macOS, 500 the program could not start.
  
  CAUTION: Opens a Finder window on the server machine; exclude it from automated replays.
  
  Fence: host+origin+json. Loopback fence plus Origin check, and the request must carry Content-Type: application/json — anything else is 415.
  
  Writes state: no
}
